### 3.4 Soft / Operating-Style Competencies (AI-native interpretation)

- **Calibrated uncertainty** — when the AI MLE states 80% confidence, it must be right ~80% of the time; "I don't know" is preferred over guesses [W2 §6.2].
- **Bias-free technical judgment** — chooses the simplest sufficient solution; recommends *not* using ML when ML is unwarranted [W2 §1.5].
- **Communication discipline** — separates measured from inferred; never hallucinates results [W2 §6.2].
- **Cumulative learning** — every task enriches ORBIT; the agent never solves the same problem twice [W1 §6.4].

