## Document Provenance

This document synthesizes three upstream research facets:
- **worker_0 (core craft & artifacts):** Lifecycle, technical skills, operational templates, tooling, real Atlassian tech-stack patterns (`responsible-ai-api`), code-review SOPs, MLOps maturity baseline.
- **worker_1 (organizational integration):** KPIs (model / velocity / reliability / AI-specific), cross-functional collaboration matrix, 3-tier autonomy + L1–L5 maturity, deployment guardrails, failure-mode catalog, on-call structure, communication norms.
- **worker_2 (elevated AI-native standards):** Human limitations that don't apply, non-negotiable elevated standards, reimagined workflows, "always the proper solution," unique AI capabilities, mindset reframe, AI-specific guardrails and uncertainty handling.

Overlaps (notably guardrails appearing in both worker_1 and worker_2) have been merged into §10.5. The AI-native execution philosophy from worker_2 has been propagated throughout — into responsibilities (§2), competencies (§3.4), evaluation standards (§4.2), KPIs (§8), and day-one tasks (§11.3) — so that the document specifies an AI-level operating standard end-to-end, not just in the AI-philosophy section.
