|---|---|---|
| **Data / model drift** | Technical | ML Lens automated detection (KS, KL, cosine); drift-triggered retraining (SOP-1); shadow deploys [W1 §4.1] |
| **Feature pipeline failures** (e.g., Tecton outage, UCT minting) | Technical | Fail-open patterns, fallback paths, schema validation, sustained-error alerting [W1 §4.2] |
